| 2b | `println(("x") + tok)` (wave-3 H-same) | rc=1 `ERR	secret` | rc=1 same; no leak | **YES** |
| 3 | `eprintln(id(1), tok)` | rc=1 `ERR	secret` eprintln | rc=1 same | **YES** |
| 4 | `println(n, tok)` | rc=1 `ERR	secret` | rc=1 same | **YES** |

